th everyone buying LIC endowment policies without reading the fine print.','yes','2026-09-19 22:23:03'),(12,'Vikram Singh','107','insurance/india/motor-insurance-india-2027-comprehensive-claim-guide','Engine Protect and Zero Dep add-ons are non-negotiable in flood-prone cities like Mumbai and Chennai. Excellent 2027 breakdown!','yes','2026-09-19 22:23:03'),(13,'Chris Taylor','108','marketing/content-marketing/types-of-content-marketing','The 1-to-10 repurposing framework is going straight to my content team\'s SOP document. Exceptional value!','yes','2026-09-19 22:23:03'),(14,'Samantha Lee','109','marketing/monopoly/how-does-a-monopoly-affect-the-economy','The microeconomic analysis of Deadweight Loss and monopsony labor power is remarkably detailed. Perfect reference guide for business leaders.','yes','2026-09-19 22:23:03');
